WEBVTT

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.840
The following program is intended for mature audiences
and contains Adult Content, Graphic Language,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.720
Graphic Violence, Brief Nudity
and Strong Sexual Content including rape.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:25.230
Mr. Mitake, was it?

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.490
This is bad. We're in for it!

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:42.120
Lord Habaki is already past Kokai River,

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.580
-and I even fell and scraped the skin on my hand.
-So it's about your skin?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.790
I'll kill you.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.300
This is all because your lazy butt wouldn't wake up!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.760
But Rin told me you looked really happy
because you had a dream of meeting Master Sori.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.260
That girl, I'll kill her later.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.060
Come to think of it...

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:05.230
Mr. Manji was really the Killer of 100, right?

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.480
Isn't that something we should tell Lord Habaki?

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:11.650
Why would we tell him? That's not our job.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.860
Yeah. You're right.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:19.780
Doesn't he seem less evil than Lord Habaki
made him out to be?

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:20.950
Mr. Manji, I mean.

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.800
Who the hell are you?

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:38.050
Are you Mr. Shira?

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:42.010
-It's him. Lord Habaki.
-Him?

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:49.520
Listen up. Shira is a demon. If you happen upon him,

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.940
answer any question he poses to you.

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.280
This is for your own sake.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:01.370
Ladies.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:05.830
You just spoke the name "Manji," didn't you?

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.790
You did, right?

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:12.800
Blade of the Immortal

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:17.800
My apologies. My bladder can't handle the cold.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:21.180
That's fine, but can you catch up with them?

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.060
Just leave it to me.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.810
In the past, I was amongst the fastest palanquin bearers.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.980
And what about now?

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:31.480
Well, you can't outrun aging, eh?

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.240
Man, I hope this wasn't a mistake.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:47.200
What now? Don't tell me you need to take another leak.

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:49.120
Hey.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.470
What? Isn't it obvious? He was asking for it.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.480
I can't believe we're being targeted
by someone like him. Damn it.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:37.380
It looks like no greeting was necessary,

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:43.680
thanks to the trail of innards
you so kindly spattered the road with.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.520
Where is Rin?

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:54.980
I killed her a while ago. Such a child like her.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:58.400
You wouldn't pull a hasty move like that.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:02.450
You'd slowly and thoroughly torture her to death
after killing me.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.700
You got me there.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.200
I'd expect no less.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:12.920
You understand me well, unlike those Mugai-ryu.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:18.590
She's alive...

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.090
but who cares about the girl?

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.010
You're the one I wanted to see.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.720
Is that so?

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:38.150
Fine by me. Let me grant that wish of yours.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:41.150
We'll settle the score here.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.150
If I win, you'll tell me where Rin--

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:46.370
Why would I tell you, idiot?

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.410
I'm going to end your life.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:52.620
That's what settling the score means here.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:56.750
If you really want to know where,
ask the kid over there.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.910
Renzo.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.790
That's a bad man.

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.630
That man...

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.170
You'll be killed as well.

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:47.220
Run away. Run.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.810
You...

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.020
So you noticed, Mr. Manji.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:00.480
This is your arm!

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:05.940
Amazing! It hurts to admit,
but it's much more free than my former hand!

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.150
You don't say!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:20.920
What is this, Mr. Manji?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.380
How am I supposed to lose like this?

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:27.720
I finally understand... you.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.430
These are sacred bloodworms, aren't they?

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.890
That's nice.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.680
What an incredibly nice feeling.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:47.110
So, this is your world?

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.790
Don't hold back now.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:59.040
I am immortal, after all.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.790
I like that!

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:04.840
I just love seeing that look on your face!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:11.390
Fool. With such poor style as yours, even if we go
sword by sword, you'll never defeat me!

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.930
That's not really a problem.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:18.680
Seeing as there are countless ways to kill an immortal.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:28.530
Hey now, you're actually strong.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:36.990
Oh, so close.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:40.210
What is this? He's different than I am.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:44.210
By the way, Mr. Manji, do you recall this?

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:48.300
I told you your whore was alive...

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.680
but her safety was something I didn't mention.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.930
Rin!

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.140
Hold it, don't be so cold.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:03.400
-Your expression went and--
-Out of the way!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.150
How terrifying.

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:13.910
There's no stopping him
when a girl's life is on the line.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.870
Dang.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.160
How far ahead could he be?

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.040
Oh, no! I hit someone!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.970
Captain, this was my own failure.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.430
You carry on at once.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.010
Very well. I will await you in Hitachi.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:43.350
Hey, buddy. Are you...?

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.480
Boy, did that spook me.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.820
Hey, it's--

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:58.990
Why? Why was it you?

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:15.590
Hey.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.440
Rin!

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.020
Ma...

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:56.130
Hey!

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.260
Please.

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:02.100
Throw me any one of the swords I dropped.

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:05.810
You can stab me with the rest all you like afterwards.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.190
If you've already become like us, I won't say any more.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.770
But if that's not the case,

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.070
do it, Renzo!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:17.490
You've got some very nice things here.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:23.990
Mr. Manji, what are you doing?

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.830
No matter how many bugs we've got,

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.370
we can be run over or frozen to death.

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:30.250
However,

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.920
if the heart at least is kept above the water line,

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:39.300
even at freezing temperatures,
humans will stubbornly cling to life.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:42.430
You should have defeated me before coming here.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:45.520
It came to this because you ran away.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:56.230
Renzo. You can stay here
until you've been well entertained.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.490
Where are you going?

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.950
I'll be killing time until these two bite it.

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:03.740
I'd say half an hour.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.450
Renzo!

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.920
Well done.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:21.010
I thought I'd have more fun than this.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:24.260
Ditch the girl and fight me.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:28.810
If you can do that, I could no longer win.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:32.810
I wouldn't even mind being cut down here and now.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:51.520
Are you perhaps forgetting your position?

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.230
Who knows?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.610
Couldn't it just be that you're detestable?

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.530
An assassin?

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.280
Taito Magatsu?

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.870
I never imagined I'd be saving him.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:11.240
Damn it, I should have just waited for him to die.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:16.210
So that old Habaki is keeping your kind around now?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.380
He's lost his--

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:30.100
How is she so fast? But...

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.100
What is she?

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.150
How is he still alive?

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:47.360
I saw that coming!

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:52.700
I'll pee on you, I swear!

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:57.040
-Are you kidding me? Just kill me normally!
-Your sword is bad.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.500
-Damn you!
-Your mouth and mind are bad too.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.920
You're a woman of face and legs alone.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:14.350
What? What's happening?

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:19.400
Master, I'm sorry! Master, I'm sorry!

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:22.980
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.750
I won't just watch a young girl die before my eyes.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.000
It's too much.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.960
Why, you...

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:00.150
Manji?

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:12.160
What happened to the girl? Tell me!

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:15.490
I couldn't save her.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.840
I thought so.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:31.840
Even I can't laugh after my lung has been stabbed.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:36.100
You don't feel any pain now, do you?

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.560
When did you realize?

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:47.190
What a cruel twisted fate for you
to end up being the successful lab rat.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:51.110
But if you don't feel any pain, I can't deny it.

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.990
You had to go to that extent?

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:59.290
You truly are a living vision of hell.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:03.330
Though from where I'm standing, that's how you appear.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.630
Besides that,

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:11.720
I'm surprised you two can stay alive
after having your girls snatched and killed by me!

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.970
Shira!

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:58.720
-Wait!
-Leave me.

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.430
I will slay him...

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:04.230
Damn it.

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.240
Mr. Manji.

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:24.160
You can't even grip a sword anymore.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:30.920
Didn't I tell you? We die surprisingly easily.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.630
It's sinking in.

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:40.180
Shira, you're the only one I can't forgive. You...

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.640
are the only person better off dead.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:47.600
And honestly, part of me wants to hurry and be at peace.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.770
I see.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:53.230
Then I'll do you a kindness and end this now.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:02.120
Man... is this really the end?

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:06.000
Painless and immortal?

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:09.580
Did I go and become too strong?

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.590
Probably.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:35.400
No! Why... won't it heal?

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:39.820
You feel no pain so you never noticed.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:42.410
Every time this cuts, it cuts deeper,

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:46.080
and your bugs have been squirming
trying to patch you up.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.120
You amateur.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:51.540
How long did you think you could stay immortal

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.210
with only the bugs from my left arm?

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:03.260
Bad. This is bad.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:06.100
If I lose my immortality here...

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:19.030
Mister!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.530
Mister, use this.

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:28.370
I was only gawking from afar,
but I want you to stay the hero until the end.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.750
You're one honest but rough-edged kid, aren't you?

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:25.010
You'll be returning Manji's left arm.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.120
What's this?

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.710
My left eye can see.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:59.250
Renzo, I know you're there.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:01.010
I'm sorry.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:04.220
I couldn't kill your father's murderer.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:09.850
But one against three... Oh, and the horse.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.890
I think I did rather well.

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:15.940
It's the winter sky.

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:18.520
How boring.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:23.400
Who knew battles with no pain could be so unfulfilling?

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.110
I wonder if that man will tire of it too.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.120
He doesn't even have someone to protect anymore.

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:35.710
That's right, that's right. That girl died, didn't she?

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:37.790
That's right.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.340
I wonder what he'll do now.

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:44.050
What a waste it is to die!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:47.680
Things were just getting interesting!

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:52.930
Who the heck are these guys? Hey, Renzo!

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:54.520
Stay over there!

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:02.820
What's this feeling? It's not a good one.

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:06.700
But I can really feel it!

00:23:10.090 --> 00:23:11.550
Hey, Renzo.

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:17.430
Give up on that vengeance. It doesn't suit you.

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:21.850
You never doubt that you're the victim,
all because your own worth has been slashed.

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:25.230
That's why you can't do the dirtiest job of all.

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:28.820
Don't become an abomination of a human.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:31.110
If you're going to be unknowingly poisoned,

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:35.080
you've got to shoulder that poison and live. Otherwise,

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:38.080
live on in dissonance forever!

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:42.380
And one more thing.

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:46.710
I really hope you don't go believing
a single word I've said.

00:23:50.300 --> 00:23:54.760
Act Twenty - Unending
